            "speakerName": "梅拉",
            "text": "♪~",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762260103"
            ]
          },
          "762260103": {
            "id": "762260103",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嘿嘿，不用客气啦。毕竟这些画还有我们的功劳呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762260104"
            ]
          },
          "762260104": {
            "id": "762260104",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "派蒙什么时候能听懂梅拉的话了？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762260105"
            ]
          },
          "762260105": {
            "id": "762260105",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "哎呀，我都和你一起去了好多次银月之庭了，能听懂梅拉的意思也不奇怪吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762260106"
            ]
          },
          "762260106": {
            "id": "762260106",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "那梅拉说画是怎么丢的？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762260107"
            ]
          },
          "762260107": {
            "id": "762260107",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "呃…这个…我理解一下哦…梅拉说…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762260108"
            ]
          },
          "762260108": {
            "id": "762260108",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "可能是其他月灵偷走的…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762260109"
            ]
          },
          "762260109": {
            "id": "762260109",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嗯…也可能是月亮上那些神奇的运输机关偷走的…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762260110"
            ]
          },
          "762260110": {
            "id": "762260110",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嗯…还可能是哥伦比娅偷走的…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762260111"
            ]
          },
          "762260111": {
            "id": "762260111",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "这个绝对不可能吧！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762260112"
            ]
          },
          "762260112": {
            "id": "762260112",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸？对哦…难道我理解错了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762260113"
            ]
          },
          "762260113": {
            "id": "762260113",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "原来只是连蒙带猜。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762260114"
            ]
          },
          "762260114": {
            "id": "762260114",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "哼哼，学习外语哪有那么容易啦…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762260115"
            ]
          },
          "762260115": {
            "id": "762260115",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
